WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:00.980 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:18.850 --> 00:22.910
I never desired anything.

00:26.930 --> 00:31.660
Without any hesitation, the
world accepted my brilliance.

00:32.510 --> 00:34.510
Just as the moon glows in the night sky.

00:35.970 --> 00:39.510
Just as it glows with
all the stars below it.

00:40.210 --> 00:42.260
It was a natural state.

00:54.290 --> 00:56.960
But then I realized...

00:58.560 --> 01:01.790
that there's a warm light in the world.

01:04.600 --> 01:07.930
That there's a sun to shine on me.

01:33.820 --> 01:37.885
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:37.886 --> 01:41.949
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:41.950 --> 01:45.015
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:45.016 --> 01:48.079
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:48.080 --> 01:50.210
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:50.840 --> 01:52.610
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:52.611 --> 01:54.379
Surely my existence is here now

01:54.380 --> 01:56.090
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:56.093 --> 01:57.425
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:57.426 --> 01:58.759
There's no more tears to cry

01:58.760 --> 02:00.885
tada dakiaeru shunkan

02:00.886 --> 02:03.010
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

02:03.470 --> 02:05.620
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

02:05.621 --> 02:07.770
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

02:07.980 --> 02:10.420
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

02:10.421 --> 02:12.859
Flowing towards the other side of time,

02:12.860 --> 02:15.195
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:15.196 --> 02:17.530
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:17.820 --> 02:20.010
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

02:20.011 --> 02:22.199
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:22.200 --> 02:26.495
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:26.496 --> 02:30.790
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:44.390 --> 02:48.049
Ah, Otoha-san, great timing!

02:48.050 --> 02:49.890
Do we have oyster sauce?

02:50.980 --> 02:52.430
Y-Yes.

02:55.370 --> 02:58.359
Sorry, we'll be using the kitchen awhile.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.610
Thank you.

03:00.110 --> 03:01.909
Could you pass that salt?

03:01.910 --> 03:03.120
Please enjoy.

03:03.490 --> 03:04.870
Excuse me.

03:07.040 --> 03:10.330
Even in my sanctuary in the end...

03:12.360 --> 03:13.880
Today's dinner:
Shiitake full course!!

03:19.170 --> 03:21.259
Maybe a bit too sweet.

03:21.260 --> 03:25.469
Chikane-chan, do you dislike sweet omelets?

03:25.470 --> 03:27.059
No, I like them.

03:27.060 --> 03:28.930
Could you taste this?

03:34.200 --> 03:35.570
How is it?

03:38.030 --> 03:39.030
Delicious.

03:39.210 --> 03:41.449
Really? Thank goodness.

03:41.450 --> 03:42.490
Then I'll put them in.

03:44.410 --> 03:45.489
It's all done.

03:45.490 --> 03:49.929
Yeah, but I think we made too much.

03:49.930 --> 03:51.000
Oh!

03:51.410 --> 03:55.750
Chikane-chan, could I
pack one more lunch box?

03:59.920 --> 04:02.385
Sixth Episode

04:02.386 --> 04:04.850
You, where the Sun Shines

04:14.520 --> 04:15.609
What's wrong?

04:15.610 --> 04:18.610
Oh, I lost my hairpin.

04:19.070 --> 04:21.239
Have you seen it?

04:21.240 --> 04:24.569
It's red with decorations on it.

04:24.570 --> 04:26.619
No, I haven't.

04:26.620 --> 04:27.620
I see.

04:28.240 --> 04:29.330
It's dear to you?

04:29.620 --> 04:33.709
Yeah, Oogami-kun gave it
to me the other day, so...

04:33.710 --> 04:35.169
Oh, it's Oogami-kun.

04:35.170 --> 04:37.590
Oogami-kun, good morning!

04:37.850 --> 04:39.999
I'll be cheering you on at today's game.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.380
Y-Yeah.

04:54.440 --> 04:55.440
Gross.

04:55.441 --> 04:58.650
Are you dumb? You're too old for that.

04:58.780 --> 05:01.899
Shut up. Kids and dumb
brutes don't get it...

05:01.900 --> 05:03.860
but this pose is an idol's life.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.360
False idol.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.490
I'm gonna call your editor.

05:07.870 --> 05:09.409
Still...

05:09.410 --> 05:13.749
to think the First Neck would
be beaten by the Seventh Neck.

05:13.750 --> 05:15.869
Is big brother dead?

05:15.870 --> 05:17.119
Who knows.

05:17.120 --> 05:19.130
Maybe he's dead somewhere.

05:19.320 --> 05:21.220
Tsubasa-sama is alive.

05:22.880 --> 05:25.480
He's merely resting.

05:26.050 --> 05:28.269
For the time to come.

05:28.270 --> 05:29.349
Really?

05:29.350 --> 05:33.020
It isn't that the Seventh
Neck won that battle.

05:33.430 --> 05:36.690
It's just that Tsubasa-sama lost.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.940
What does that mean?

05:39.520 --> 05:41.740
Brother complex.

05:58.500 --> 05:59.670
Here you are.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.169
Chikane-chan.

06:01.170 --> 06:04.510
You didn't come to the usual place,
so I wondered where you were.

06:05.170 --> 06:08.509
The usual place? It's already lunchtime?

06:08.510 --> 06:09.340
Yes.

06:09.341 --> 06:12.180
Oh, I still haven't...

06:13.060 --> 06:14.140
You haven't given it?

06:15.430 --> 06:19.150
Oogami-kun is popular,
so it can't be helped.

06:19.850 --> 06:22.689
And I didn't promise this or anything.

06:22.690 --> 06:24.900
Chikane-chan, are you hungry?

06:25.990 --> 06:30.409
It's a bit much, but why don't
we eat the three lunch boxes?

06:30.410 --> 06:32.740
Oh, but we might get fat.

06:33.780 --> 06:34.780
We can't.

06:36.160 --> 06:37.789
Wait on the roof.

06:37.790 --> 06:39.670
I'll be right there.

06:40.460 --> 06:41.669
Oogami-kun...

06:41.670 --> 06:45.549
We'll form a cheerleading
team, so look forward to it.

06:45.550 --> 06:47.419
Hold on a second.

06:47.420 --> 06:48.720
Oogami-san.

06:51.010 --> 06:52.089
Himemiya.

06:52.090 --> 06:53.979
M-Miya-sama.

06:53.980 --> 06:55.470
Excuse us.

07:00.440 --> 07:03.479
Miya-sama and the prince really are dating.

07:03.480 --> 07:05.730
Of course. I admire them so much.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.149
Do you have time?

07:08.150 --> 07:09.740
Yeah, sure.

07:14.120 --> 07:16.330
U-Um, uh...

07:18.700 --> 07:23.330
I prepared too much for
lunch, so if you'd like...

07:23.710 --> 07:25.289
You made it?

07:25.290 --> 07:29.010
Yes, but I didn't do a very good job...

07:30.380 --> 07:32.050
Oh, Chikane-chan.

07:33.930 --> 07:39.270
Let's all eat together since
we have the same lunch.

07:40.730 --> 07:42.140
Chikane-chan?

07:42.810 --> 07:44.130
I'm sorry.

07:44.400 --> 07:47.930
I have to go see a professor.

07:48.440 --> 07:49.440
I see...

07:50.070 --> 07:51.490
Do your best.

08:03.790 --> 08:05.920
Yes, that smile.

08:06.590 --> 08:09.670
That smile is my sunlight.

08:10.880 --> 08:14.839
It has a collar on, so
I'm thinking it's lost.

08:14.840 --> 08:15.840
I see.

08:15.930 --> 08:19.240
I'm sure it's from around here.

08:21.020 --> 08:24.059
I'll go search around a bit more.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.269
Bye.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.270
Wait.

08:26.440 --> 08:30.649
I'll look into it. If it's nearby,
I think I'll find out soon.

08:30.650 --> 08:33.719
Really? Thank you, um...

08:33.720 --> 08:35.409
Himemiya Chikane.

08:35.410 --> 08:36.740
Thank you, Chikane-chan.

08:37.030 --> 08:38.740
"Chikane-chan"?

08:38.970 --> 08:40.039
Was it wrong?

08:40.040 --> 08:42.499
No, pleased to meet you, um...

08:42.500 --> 08:45.999
Oh, Himeko. Kurusugawa Himeko.

08:46.000 --> 08:49.129
To think someone would
call me Chikane-chan.

08:49.130 --> 08:53.919
To think someone would talk about
herself and smile so naturally.

08:53.920 --> 08:58.450
It was the moment I recognized
the light that embraced me.

09:00.510 --> 09:05.639
Then that person suddenly stopped
and dropped the cup in their hands.

09:05.640 --> 09:06.440
Really.

09:06.440 --> 09:07.150
And then...

09:07.151 --> 09:11.030
Oh, sorry for kind of being
the only one talking.

09:11.320 --> 09:14.029
It's okay. I enjoy your stories.

09:14.030 --> 09:15.109
Really?

09:15.110 --> 09:18.740
That's the first time I've been told that.
It feels strange.

09:20.740 --> 09:24.459
Because I usually don't talk this much.

09:24.460 --> 09:27.000
I'm usually a bit shy.

09:27.370 --> 09:28.669
Me too.

09:28.670 --> 09:32.759
I rarely have the chance to
talk to someone like this.

09:32.760 --> 09:34.050
Really?

09:37.260 --> 09:38.260
Hey!

09:39.350 --> 09:42.140
Jeez, he's so dirty. And I just...

09:44.230 --> 09:45.480
Oh.

09:45.940 --> 09:48.059
Oh no! Are you okay?

09:48.060 --> 09:50.359
I'm fine, but how about you?

09:50.360 --> 09:53.230
I'm okay. I'm dirty anyway.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.909
J-Just a minute.

10:03.910 --> 10:07.290
The wind's strong, so
you should put this on.

10:08.330 --> 10:09.830
You can have that.

10:10.420 --> 10:14.000
How should I describe my
feelings at that moment?

10:14.380 --> 10:16.690
The warmth of someone's embrace.

10:16.970 --> 10:19.470
The first comfort I ever experienced.

10:20.120 --> 10:23.560
I felt I didn't want to let go of her.

10:24.060 --> 10:25.809
I was obsessed.

10:25.810 --> 10:26.850
So...

10:30.610 --> 10:36.360
I feel terrible for making Lady
Himemiya do such a thing for me.

10:36.560 --> 10:37.989
No, we...

10:37.990 --> 10:40.409
I don't know how to thank you.

10:40.410 --> 10:43.620
Thank you so much. Thank you so much.

10:50.540 --> 10:52.130
Good day, Miya-sama.

10:52.630 --> 10:53.630
Good day.

10:53.631 --> 10:55.249
Good day, Miya-sama.

10:55.250 --> 10:56.590
Good day.

10:58.880 --> 10:59.880
Kurusugawa-san.

11:02.970 --> 11:07.519
Good day, Kurusugawa-san. I
borrowed this yesterday.

11:07.520 --> 11:08.680
I'm very sorry.

11:10.980 --> 11:13.439
Please forgive all my rudeness.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.859
U-Um, I didn't know, Chika...

11:15.860 --> 11:20.029
No, Miya-sama, that you were
a person of such stature.

11:20.030 --> 11:21.910
E-Excuse me.

11:23.620 --> 11:25.080
Please wait.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.540
For me to run...

11:29.200 --> 11:31.960
For me to chase after someone...

11:38.050 --> 11:41.510
But I wanted to talk with Himeko.

11:42.510 --> 11:45.640
I wanted to see her innocent smiles.

11:46.430 --> 11:49.220
For that, I did anything I could.

11:50.940 --> 11:52.920
To spend time with Himeko.

11:54.940 --> 11:56.320
That alone...

11:58.860 --> 12:00.690
made me happy.

12:05.370 --> 12:06.580
Yet...

12:16.710 --> 12:17.960
Oh...

12:18.210 --> 12:20.340
Looks interesting.

12:36.400 --> 12:37.480
And then...

12:37.770 --> 12:40.480
Oogami-kun said it was good.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.739
I see. That's good.

12:42.740 --> 12:46.489
But I think he didn't
like the sweet omelet.

12:46.490 --> 12:49.770
He didn't look that happy.

12:50.080 --> 12:51.250
I see.

12:51.660 --> 12:55.750
I guess boys don't like sweet ones.

12:56.460 --> 12:58.500
I wouldn't know.

12:58.790 --> 13:02.720
If he doesn't like them, he should tell me.

13:03.590 --> 13:06.220
Why not make a different kind next time?

13:06.510 --> 13:08.299
Oh, right.

13:08.300 --> 13:10.720
Well, actually...

13:11.060 --> 13:14.980
I was asked out next Sunday.

13:16.650 --> 13:17.980
I see.

13:18.230 --> 13:21.070
Should I go?

13:24.110 --> 13:25.280
Chikane-chan?

13:30.620 --> 13:32.270
It's almost time.

13:33.660 --> 13:35.750
Oh, right.

13:45.510 --> 13:48.760
God of Takemi Katana.
God of Iwatsutsu no O.

13:49.180 --> 13:52.770
God of Kanayama Hiko. God of Kanayama Hime.

13:53.520 --> 13:56.979
God of Tsurugi no Ikusa.
God of Tate no Tsusa.

13:56.980 --> 14:00.060
Along with the powers of
the eight million gods.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.070
I must protect her.

14:02.570 --> 14:06.070
If I gain the power to
protect her, Himeko will...

14:10.120 --> 14:12.659
Himeko, are you all right?

14:12.660 --> 14:13.700
Sorry.

14:14.830 --> 14:15.949
Himeko.

14:15.950 --> 14:17.459
I'm fine.

14:17.460 --> 14:18.870
Let's continue.

14:22.290 --> 14:23.630
Almost.

14:33.350 --> 14:34.350
Himeko.

14:36.060 --> 14:37.060
No!

14:37.770 --> 14:41.150
What if it was you? What can you do?

14:42.440 --> 14:45.150
Let's hang in there. We're so close.

14:45.440 --> 14:50.610
Just a bit more, so please. A
bit more and I can protect you.

14:51.120 --> 14:53.449
Without the aid of others.

14:53.450 --> 14:54.620
Kurusugawa-kun!

14:57.080 --> 14:58.499
Are you okay?

14:58.500 --> 15:02.000
Let's stop for today. It's
impossible to continue.

15:02.670 --> 15:04.250
Kurusugawa-san...

15:04.510 --> 15:07.260
Chikane-chan...

15:09.220 --> 15:10.580
I'm sorry.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.840
I...

15:15.220 --> 15:18.270
The ritual is being performed perfectly.

15:18.450 --> 15:21.730
But could something be lacking?

15:31.110 --> 15:33.820
I made Himeko...

15:36.910 --> 15:39.660
Why did I do such a thing?

15:47.840 --> 15:53.640
Yeah, so this Sunday is
probably not going to work.

15:54.010 --> 15:56.680
No, not the following Sunday.

15:57.140 --> 15:59.429
No, it's not that.

15:59.430 --> 16:01.190
It's because there are things I have to do.

16:02.230 --> 16:06.250
Because I'm always causing
trouble for Chikane-chan.

16:07.020 --> 16:09.820
And she always takes care of me.

16:10.780 --> 16:13.179
Okay, thank you.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.619
I'll do my best.

16:14.620 --> 16:15.660
Bye.

16:30.460 --> 16:34.339
All right, I'm off. How are your wounds?

16:34.340 --> 16:35.639
Fine now.

16:35.640 --> 16:36.640
I see.

16:36.850 --> 16:39.100
Don't worry, niisan.

16:39.510 --> 16:41.520
Tsubasa-niisan is still alive.

16:41.810 --> 16:43.020
Souma.

16:43.310 --> 16:47.770
If it's Tsubasa-niisan, I feel
he'll understand someday.

16:49.070 --> 16:50.280
Sorry to keep you.

16:50.650 --> 16:52.819
Huh? Why are you here?

16:52.820 --> 16:55.909
To see you off. You'll be gone for a while.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.870
Yeah, but...

16:59.160 --> 17:00.659
You have a date.

17:00.660 --> 17:04.669
You read it again without my permission?
It got cancelled.

17:04.670 --> 17:05.789
No way.

17:05.790 --> 17:07.039
I see.

17:07.040 --> 17:11.219
Oh well, experiencing things
while you're young is important.

17:11.220 --> 17:16.049
Hey, there are lots of great women,
so one or two broken hearts...

17:16.050 --> 17:18.800
There are no broken hearts. Please leave.

17:22.680 --> 17:25.809
I must hurry, for Souma's sake.

17:25.810 --> 17:28.810
I need to watch out for him.

17:35.280 --> 17:36.280
Himeko.

17:40.870 --> 17:41.990
Chikane-chan?

17:42.490 --> 17:44.000
Good morning, Himeko.

17:44.240 --> 17:46.869
Eh? Is today Monday?

17:46.870 --> 17:50.170
No, you're going out
with Oogami-kun, right?

17:51.550 --> 17:55.760
So wake up, or else he'll
see your sleepy face.

18:01.140 --> 18:02.929
It becomes you.

18:02.930 --> 18:03.930
Chikane-chan...

18:04.220 --> 18:08.229
But if it's this dress, a
more mature look is better.

18:08.230 --> 18:09.269
Hold on a minute.

18:09.270 --> 18:10.510
Hold on a minute. Chikane-chan.

18:11.770 --> 18:14.320
I can't go.

18:15.650 --> 18:16.779
Why not?

18:16.780 --> 18:21.389
Because I shouldn't be doing this.

18:21.390 --> 18:24.449
If I can't do it, everyone
will be in trouble.

18:24.450 --> 18:26.000
I have to do it.

18:28.000 --> 18:33.240
Himeko, do you know why I
brought you to this house?

18:33.920 --> 18:37.510
Do you know why I decided
to break the seal with you?

18:37.970 --> 18:40.429
Because you want to defeat Orochi?

18:40.430 --> 18:41.679
That's not it.

18:41.680 --> 18:43.260
Because you want to protect everyone?

18:44.850 --> 18:46.850
There's that too, but no.

18:47.930 --> 18:48.930
Then...

18:49.190 --> 18:51.900
Because I want you to be happy.

18:52.690 --> 18:55.109
Because I want you to be smiling.

18:55.110 --> 18:56.110
That's why.

18:58.360 --> 18:59.820
Chikane-chan...

19:00.360 --> 19:01.819
Don't cry.

19:01.820 --> 19:04.370
It'll be embarrassing
if Oogami-kun sees you.

19:11.920 --> 19:14.289
It's like it's not me.

19:14.290 --> 19:16.129
That can't be.

19:16.130 --> 19:19.799
Say, Chikane-chan, I have a favor to ask.

19:19.800 --> 19:20.340
What is it?

19:20.570 --> 19:23.139
I want you to do my hair.

19:23.140 --> 19:24.640
I'm okay...

19:25.100 --> 19:27.850
with being touched now.

19:28.560 --> 19:30.350
Sure, I'll be happy to.

19:36.070 --> 19:39.109
This is from back when we first met.

19:39.110 --> 19:40.449
You noticed?

19:40.450 --> 19:41.450
Hold on a minute.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.330
Thank you.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.390
Take care.

20:07.930 --> 20:08.930
I'm off.

20:30.120 --> 20:31.409
Himeko...

20:31.410 --> 20:32.790
Himeko.

20:35.290 --> 20:36.570
Himeko...

20:37.000 --> 20:38.000
Himeko...

20:53.390 --> 20:54.600
Himeko...

20:59.900 --> 21:03.529
Why is she making me
sortie all of a sudden?

21:03.530 --> 21:04.819
I don't know.

21:04.820 --> 21:07.530
Miyako said to just go and destroy things.

21:08.250 --> 21:09.529
A foreshadow?

21:09.530 --> 21:11.239
No choice, I guess.

21:11.240 --> 21:14.499
It'll be a mess if I upset the Second Neck.

21:14.500 --> 21:15.769
I'll do it.

21:15.770 --> 21:18.079
Will I boom things with Meow-Meow?

21:18.080 --> 21:20.300
Now that my script is done...

21:24.720 --> 21:26.890
It was the right choice.

21:27.970 --> 21:30.430
If it brings Himeko a smile...

22:10.050 --> 22:11.720
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.723 --> 22:13.720
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.723 --> 22:15.535
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.536 --> 22:17.349
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.350 --> 22:20.940
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.943 --> 22:22.460
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.461 --> 22:23.979
At least... yes, only now

22:23.980 --> 22:26.360
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.363 --> 22:28.360
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.363 --> 22:32.030
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.033 --> 22:33.620
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.623 --> 22:35.830
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.831 --> 22:38.039
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.040 --> 22:40.375
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.376 --> 22:42.709
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.710 --> 22:45.650
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.651 --> 22:48.589
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.590 --> 22:50.635
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.636 --> 22:52.680
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.510 --> 22:54.930
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.931 --> 22:56.349
Just by being by my side

22:56.350 --> 22:58.165
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.166 --> 22:59.979
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.980 --> 23:03.440
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.441 --> 23:06.899
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.900 --> 23:08.880
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.881 --> 23:10.859
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.860 --> 23:12.675
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.676 --> 23:14.489
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.490 --> 23:16.305
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.306 --> 23:18.119
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.120 --> 23:23.645
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.646 --> 23:29.170
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:39.980 --> 23:40.980
Next Time

23:40.981 --> 23:41.980
Next Time

23:40.981 --> 23:41.981
Next Time

23:42.060 --> 23:45.769
It's a mirror. A mirror
that reflects the heart.

23:45.770 --> 23:47.570
Only thoughts are reflected.

23:47.980 --> 23:50.340
Deep feelings I want to convey.

23:50.610 --> 23:53.410
There should be only one truth.

23:53.910 --> 23:56.989
Only one thing I want to convey.

23:56.990 --> 23:58.999
But it doesn't reach its destination.

23:59.000 --> 24:06.000
Rainfall in the Hell of Love

23:59.790 --> 24:03.249
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 7.

24:03.250 --> 24:05.080
Rainfall in the Hell of Love.

24:05.420 --> 24:08.610
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
